// Level 0 - building services of the ground floor and the plant at the
// base of the west shaft
//
// District heat enters through the north wall into a compact transfer station
// at the base of the shaft (heat exchanger, circulation pump); its secondary
// circuit rises to the air handler coils on the roof. The sprinkler main
// comes up through the ground slab to the alarm valve station in the shaft.
// Rain water leaves the shaft through the ground slab.
// No suspended ceilings except in the toilets (3.66 m): ducts at 3.7 m,
// sprinkler pipes at 3.92 m below the slab soffit (4.09 m), pendant diffusers,
// heads and lights below them. The mensa is supplied; its air flows over into
// the kitchen, which is extracted through hoods over the islands and the
// cooking line. The foyer is supplied and exhausts through the atrium. The
// toilets are ventilated through their windows and get cold water only.
// The Audimax has its own ventilation, which is not modeled.
// The main LV board in the east lobby feeds the power riser.

import materials from "../materials.bml"
import systems from "./systems.bml"

# Site: Campus Nord

## Building: Forum Nord

